      "source": "https://www.japan-guide.com/e/e4009.html",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Umeda Sky Building, 173 meters tall, opened in 1993 and features an open‑air observation deck on its roof.",
